{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/aks/periscope","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:11:51.933Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/aks/periscope/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/aks/periscope/about"},"readme":"## About\n\nThis image contains the AKS Periscope application, which can be used to collect detailed diagnostic information for AKS clusters.\n\n## Featured Tags\n\n- `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/aks/periscope:latest`\n- `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/aks/periscope-win:latest`\n\n## Related Repositories\n\n- [AKS Periscope](https://github.com/Azure/aks-periscope)\n\n## Configuration\n\nThis image is designed to be run in a DaemonSet inside an AKS cluster. The [kustomize spec](https://github.com/Azure/aks-periscope/blob/master/deployment/base/kustomization.yaml) shows the configuration options and required secrets.\n\nSince AKS Periscope uploads its logs to an Azure Storage account, the account details and SAS Key must be provided.\n\n## Usage\n\nAKS Periscope can be deployed as a `kustomize` template, as described in the project [README](https://github.com/Azure/aks-periscope/blob/master/README.md#dependent-consuming-tools-and-working-contract).\n\nFor a more streamlined deployment experience, AKS Periscope can also be launched from:\n- the VS Code [AKS extension](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/azure/aksextensions)\n- the `az aks kollect` [command](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/cli/azure/aks?view=azure-cli-latest#az-aks-kollect) in the `az` CLI [tool](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/cli/azure/) (with `aks-preview` extension)\n\n## Support\n\nFor support or general questions, please post in our [forum](https://github.com/Azure/aks-periscope/issues).\n\n## License\n\n- Legal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice)\n\nView [license information](https://github.com/Azure/aks-periscope/blob/master/LICENSE) for the software contained in this image.","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2024-08-07T00:15:41.5719204+00:00","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":"MIT","links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"64K+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"0.0.13","digest":"sha256:2c7be74ea59a36f57cad9c36837e0e09082b46c05410b70d6abb710ef993efcb","pushed":"2024-08-07T00:15:43.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"0.0.13-mariner2.0","digest":"sha256:76abefcee33116f853c9a07e6d75ad1791cec9b76a7ee6549a2e05b71ffcb12b","pushed":"2024-08-07T00:09:39.0000000+00:00","size":3041,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"0.0.13-nanoserver2019","digest":"sha256:d7aa413918ac266a1f88165f2ffb5cf7fad1d8fe458a02a30039b5f009c09fab","pushed":"2023-04-26T00:34:05.0000000+00:00","size":1674,"platforms":["windows/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"0.0.13-nanoserver2022","digest":"sha256:f0b441a28039f117d3abe1d96ed550ac9dc4e9ca60804f55012efc6c83d9ecfb","pushed":"2023-04-26T00:28:30.0000000+00:00","size":1674,"platforms":["windows/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"0.0.12","digest":"sha256:ac55d8b92ed18680a541305651bf01a3cb5ed85ca78824405024b7aeab6aeeb9","pushed":"2023-02-08T21:00:58.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"0.0.12-nanoserver2019","digest":"sha256:0a1b43b3b8484df46fe4a956e762f35edb148afe8cff169119cc3bf9ad537d75","pushed":"2023-02-08T21:00:30.0000000+00:00","size":1676,"platforms":["windows/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/v